              </svg>
              <span>Early screening of developmental issues</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>Personalized program recommendations</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>Progress tracking for child and mother</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-pink-50 dark:bg-pink-900/20 rounded-lg">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-pink-800 dark:text-pink-200 mb-2">Unique Benefits</h4>
            <p class="text-pink-700 dark:text-pink-300 text-sm">
              TogetherMama combines 24/7 AI with human psychologist support to accompany mothers on their child-rearing journey. This system can identify developmental issues in children at early stages and provide practical solutions. The platform also offers community support products where parents can connect with others facing similar challenges, creating a supportive network for modern parenting.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 flex gap-3">
            <a href="#" class="inline-block bg-pink-600 hover:bg-pink-700 text-white font-medium py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300">
              Visit Project
            </a>
            <a href="/hampaye-madar" class="inline-block bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-pink-600 border border-pink-600 font-medium py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300">
              More Details
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Baham -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-6 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <span class="text-2xl">🛒</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3">Baham</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
            Platform for group buying to reduce everyday expenses
          </p>
          <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4">
            <Image 
              src={bahamImage} 
              alt="Baham" 
              class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
              width={400} 
              height={250}
              format="webp"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <ul class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-500 mr-2 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
