            <p class="text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-sm">
              Baham leverages collective bargaining power to reduce product prices by creating a network of buyers. This platform can analyze user consumption patterns and provide personalized recommendations. With products like price tracking and deal alerts, users can maximize their savings while building a community of like-minded individuals focused on smart consumption.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 flex gap-3">
            <a href="#" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium py-2 px-4 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-300">
